生きてる“アイドル”
I continue to live as an idol.

850
01:00:08,666 --> 01:00:09,776
アイドル
An idol.

851
01:00:09,946 --> 01:00:12,276
バカにする奴は嫌いだ
I hate the people who make fun of me

