854
01:00:17,476 --> 01:00:20,276
見てもいないくせに言うな
Don't say them when you haven't even actually seen them!

855
01:00:20,436 --> 01:00:22,186
頑張りを当然と言うな
Don't take my hard work for granted

856
01:00:22,186 --> 01:00:24,456
イメージとか強制するな
Don't force an image on me

